In addition to the other violations of this division specified herein, it shall be unlawful and a violation of the provisions of this division for any person to do any of the following:
(1) Overtime parking: To cause, allow, permit or suffer any vehicle registered in the name of, or operated by, such person, to be parked in any parking space beyond the period of lawful parking time established for such space in this division;
(2) Parking across lines, markings: To park any vehicle across any line or marking of a parking space or in such position that the vehicle shall not be entirely within the area designated such lines of marking;
(3) Defacing, tampering with: To deface, damage, tamper with or destroy, or impair the usefulness of, any parking sign installed under the provisions of this division.
